{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ba46b1a446da748b454c14f8e108a46b40fcf3b8c84ec456709de7188e6134b", "ja": "（今回の星梨花の衣装は『Melty Fantasia』の\n世界観の通りに、アンドロイドだ！）", "zh": "（这次星梨花的服装，完全符合《Melty Fantasia》的世界观，\n是安卓机器人！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ac58eee5e6f0964c4a27297267172f21862d00a51270688923558885b7d9942", "ja": "えへへ……何回着ても、うれしい気持ちになりますね♪\nとっても素敵で、お気に入りの衣装なんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿……不管穿多少次，都会让人感到开心呢♪\n这套服装特别漂亮，我很喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1002_p", "source_sha256": "769530cdd2a310d493433c467da3d46567a7c309ee5b7097f6f465747ff65b05", "ja": "ははっ。それはよかった。\nカッコよさと、可愛さのバランスが絶妙だよな。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。\n帅气与可爱的平衡恰到好处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "8ad5882db3a412a3e90c31640787d3778eb625b3b407c03342ac4e5b0a667248", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんも、\nそう思いますか？", "zh": "是的！您也觉得{$P$}先生很帅气又可爱，平衡得恰到好处吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "f52ff5b087a571712b1c631680d778871dbc6a3c6f2bc2cfc2a728c46652dcc4", "ja": "パッと見ただけだと、カッコいいアンドロイドに\n見えるんですけど。それだけじゃないんです！", "zh": "乍一看，感觉像是很帅气的仿生人。不过，可不只是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "541c0a861a1afa311f1141425958d8e5e8a51329a063966bf7aeef868fff5f1c", "ja": "よく見ると、リボンとかフリルとかもあって……\nすごくかわいいんです！", "zh": "仔细看的话，还有丝带和荷叶边之类的……\n非常可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5ba6c71896ecf0447a25fe15e356444c9a7f95af9dbee0891157226eac241bab", "ja": "そうだな、星梨花によく似合ってるよ。\nさあ、あとは公演に向けて、準備を進めないとな。", "zh": "是啊，很适合星梨花。\n好了，接下来得为公演继续做准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "6afd4d2c1fffce62b27494e620c3a521696b559c379661096ff1dea86cb00d13", "ja": "はい！\n……あ、でも。……。", "zh": "好的！\n……啊，不过…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1008_p", "source_sha256": "640e18e0f8d9e61639fd16f7a2fc3b35f4727f6e06383b7cef686377c5a61fd2", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ、星梨花？", "zh": "？怎么了，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "868f94d9298b433bb2bb9d1e9306231fa793a182057dd453544656f030b44093", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nわたし、今回の公演、あんまり自信がないんです……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n对于这次的演出，我其实没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e3c880ea24ee2db47925530c1e8ea432a741a46511b17cddad2f5162a58b362e", "ja": "えっ！　どうして？", "zh": "咦！为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "c2f56b907c1ea21bcfb4efa587ea29076a7f74cf9330d1eedb480fb2d0514ec6", "ja": "わたしが演じるセリカ型は、『ココロ』……\n感情を持たないアンドロイドですよね？", "zh": "我饰演的星梨花型，是“心”……\n没有感情的仿生人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "a4e96d9bc233fa99d8140ba1cb3414a90aef8922a292232e92e034649b89a3a0", "ja": "でもわたし、会場にいるみなさんの顔を見ると、\n笑顔になっちゃうんです。", "zh": "但是，我一看到会场里大家的脸，就会忍不住露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b039d1f2f6b96d165f285a1807d9f017bbba830ceea0d6bc0bbdad949d744d74", "ja": "だから公演の間、アンドロイドとして\nずっと感情を出さないっていうのが、難しくて。", "zh": "所以在演出期间，要以仿生人的身份一直不流露感情，对我来说很难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1014_p", "source_sha256": "68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097", "ja": "なるほど……。", "zh": "原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "180dd8e4166a5c28796e11399a114c2c95f65b834f5ff083c007f9cd7728be68", "ja": "それに、ぜんぜん笑わないでいると、\nみんなが楽しくないかも……？って心配で。", "zh": "而且，要是一直完全不笑的话，大家可能也会觉得不开心……所以我有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "8105eddecc171f0362225f25dbf94501f6181886494f69d99850c701dcdaab77", "ja": "でも、いつも通りにしたら、\nセリカ型じゃなくなっちゃいますし。うーん……。", "zh": "可是，要是表现得和平时一样，就会变得不像星梨花了。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ec2695134cac160a7c3ee02f054b70c4577ea3c08c373cf69bce1687ffba64bd", "ja": "それで自信がないか、なるほど……。\n星梨花の言う事も、一理あるな。", "zh": "所以是因为没有自信吗，原来如此……\n星梨花说的也有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1018_p", "source_sha256": "55c5370c2431d9586d2fe6b35a146115bed28c1926f358e47893fb70e8389f8d", "ja": "なら、いつもの星梨花とセリカ型、\n両方見せればいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "那就把平时的星梨花和星梨花型都展示出来，不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "e419ff3cd94d82b62a35e71f980d25aae8c10bace5e6ffef0205268310bf5b5a", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}さん……\nそんなこと、できるんですか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生……\n那种事，真的能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1020_p", "source_sha256": "52563ebbab28c3feea4952c71d90487f89a36e955790e614642b2529e51c7f00", "ja": "うん。演出で、公演に物語性を持たせようかなって。\n最初は『ココロ』を持たない状態で登場して……。", "zh": "嗯。我想通过演出设计，让整场公演带有一点故事性。\n一开始以没有“心”的状态登场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1666b44663a6b27728b91e39cc784336c47e38fbf5be666f137d90fed6c81357", "ja": "終盤に向けて、少しずつ楽しい曲が増えていったら。\n星梨花が笑顔でも、気にならないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "如果朝着后半段，开心的歌曲一点点增加的话，就算星梨花露出笑容，也不会觉得奇怪了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "2c2bc0d33760bcd124c11ad6d549baabb6e0cd7c76d39a247531bb1b1bde1650", "ja": "あっ！　それって……ライブを通して、少しずつ\n『楽しい』気持ちが芽生えてくるってことですね！", "zh": "啊！也就是说……通过整场演唱会，『开心』的心情会一点点萌芽，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e389a2735e366fe72a4e713f1a7dab9b0c79603fc3378642c5eea60605c9c5c0", "ja": "ああ。公演を通して、物語を体験するんだ。\n……せっかくだから、星梨花も一緒に考えてみるか？", "zh": "嗯。通过这场公演，去亲身体验故事。\n……难得有这个机会，星梨花也一起来想想吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0634_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a44d8c327da5a1b33468eb54d51e0173655a1c8800d6bfbf7f30e421fa8ef56", "ja": "はい、お願いします！　えへへ、何だかワクワク\nしてきました。素敵なステージになるといいなぁ……♪", "zh": "好的，拜托您了！嘿嘿，感觉越来越期待了。希望能成为一场精彩的演出……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
